Description: Sovereign unified theming engine for openOODA
 oote is the sovereign unified theming and color styling engine for the
 openOODA ecosystem. It provides 25 seasonal and monthly themes, dual
 light/dark modes, custom border styles, and expressive ASCII mascots.
